    "description": "Local Hookup Dating was created to help singles meet new people, make new friends and eventually find a date. Our dynamic match system helps you easily find local singles looking to either chat, date or even a casual hook up. Not a fan of location based dating and just looking for someone to match and have a conversation with? Try our Singles Discover feature where you can find online singles from around the world seeking only a friend or possibly a long distance relationship.\r\n\r\nStart your dating adventure with Local Hook up Dating and you too can meet someone new and find local dates. Local Hookups helps you navigate the tinder box of online dating apps by combining the best features from all your favorite dating apps and sating sites. No matter your gender preference you can use our filters to find single girls and singles guys in your city. Use our intuitive search feature to find what you are looking for! You can search for specific niches like cougar dating, affair dating, one night stands and much more! We even have a Video Chat feature for those that want a no strings attached casual encounter from their own home.\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fOur Favorite Features \u2764\ufe0f\r\n\u2705 People and friend finder - Easily find and meet new people nearby and form meaningful connections\r\n\u2705 Easy to Use Chat and Social Messaging - Send and receive private photos and gifs to your matches.\r\n\u2705 Send and receive unlimited likes for free!\r\n\u2705 Variety of Dating options - Whether you are only looking for friend, discreet hook ups or just a casual dates.\r\n\r\nLocal Hook up Dating App is one of the best dating apps for singles since you can get matches and chat easily to get a date or a hot one night stand. Unlike other hookup apps, we are not only fans of hookups but we strive to find you relationships of any kind.\r\n\r\nTap install now and get our dating app free!\r\n\r\nLocal Hookup is free to download and use. However, if you\u2019re looking to increase your chances of finding match and date, we offer an optional premium subscription called GOLD. GOLD unlocks exclusive features like photo messaging, unlimited likes and more! Full details can be found on our app.\r\n\r\nIf you don\u2019t choose to purchase our Gold subscription, you can simply continue using Local Hookup FREE\r\n\r\nOur app app requires you to be and adult over the age of 18+ to use. Since our app caters to a variety of individuals and orientations users must adhere to the rules of not sending offensive messages, hate speech or uploading explicit content on our platform. \r\n\r\nFor further information, please be sure to read our privacy policy and terms and conditions:\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://localhookupdating.com/privacy/\r\nTerms of service: https://localhookupdating.com/terms/",
